{"segments": [
 {"id": "c03-title-01", "scene": "c03-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Chapter three. The joining ḥarfs.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["title"]},
 {"id": "c03-title-02", "scene": "c03-title", "lang": "ar", "text": "حُرُوفُ العَطْفِ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-title-03", "scene": "c03-title", "lang": "en", "text": "They join a word to the word before it.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["sub"]},
 {"id": "c03-title-04", "scene": "c03-title", "lang": "en", "text": "The rule from Stage one stays. The word after them copies the ending of the word before.", "pause": 0.7, "cues": ["hl:the word after them copies the ending of the word before"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-01", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "The first is wa. It means and. It is written joined to the next word.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:1", "mark:1"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-02", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "الكِتَابُ وَالقَلَمُ عَلَى المَكْتَبِ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-03", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "The book and the pen are on the desk. The pen copies the damma of the book.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-04", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "The second ḥarf is also joined. It means and, right after.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:2", "mark:2"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-05", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "دَخَلَ مُحَمَّدٌ فَخَالِدٌ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-06", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Muhammad came in, and Khalid right after him.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-07", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "ثُمَّ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:3", "mark:3"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-08", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Then, after a while.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-09", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "خَرَجَ حَامِدٌ ثُمَّ يَاسِرٌ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-10", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Hamid went out, then Yasir.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-11", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "The fourth ḥarf means or.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:4", "mark:4"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-12", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِشْرَبِ المَاءَ أَوِ اللَّبَنَ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-13", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Drink the water or the milk.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-14", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "بَلْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:5", "mark:5"]},
 {"id": "c03-table-15", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "No, rather. It makes a correction.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-16", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "هَذَا كِتَابٌ بَلْ دَفْتَرٌ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-table-17", "scene": "c03-table", "lang": "en", "text": "This is a book. No, rather a notebook.", "pause": 0.7, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-01", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Let us look at two of them closely.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-02", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "دَخَلَ مُحَمَّدٌ فَخَالِدٌ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:1"]},
 {"id": "c03-examples-03", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Muhammad came in, and Khalid right after him.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-04", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Khalid copies the damma of Muhammad.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:1"]},
 {"id": "c03-examples-05", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "مُحَمَّدٌ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-06", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "خَالِدٌ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-07", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِشْرَبِ المَاءَ أَوِ اللَّبَنَ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:2"]},
 {"id": "c03-examples-08", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Drink the water or the milk.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-09", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "The milk copies the fatha of the water.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:2"]},
 {"id": "c03-examples-10", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "المَاءَ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-11", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "اللَّبَنَ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-12", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Look at the ḥarf that means or. It ends in sukūn.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-13", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Before al, it takes a helping kasra. The ḥarf is still fixed.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c03-examples-14", "scene": "c03-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "أَوِ اللَّبَنَ", "pause": 0.8, "cues": []}
]}
